<title>BELGIUM: CYCLING-GAUMONT WINS GHENT-WEVELGEM RACE.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-GAUMONT WINS GHENT-WEVELGEM RACE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>France's Philippe Gaumont won the 208- km Ghent-Wavelgem race in a sprint finish contested by about 20 riders on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
